><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-68ae1cfec12a4e9fEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ed1536d700dc727eEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_VaultsLedger</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_VaultsLedger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_VaultsLedger\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6c622922-fd5b-452a-80b1-d567b5fcefa1</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6c622922-fd5b-452a-80b1-d567b5fcefa1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6c622922-fd5b-452a-80b1-d567b5fcefa1\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#The_Counting_House_-_Vaults\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House Vaults</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-996&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;781</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This log records a list of recent visits to the Counting House vaults.]\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Bloris_Meadhoney\" title=\"Bloris Meadhoney\">Bloris Meadhoney</a>.\n</p><p>Pocket registry: bank pass, gold coins, <a href=\"/wiki/Rakath_Glitterbeard\" title=\"Rakath Glitterbeard\">Mr Glitterbeard's</a> book of Dwarven Dates.\n</p><p>Reason for visit: delivery of a large chest to the high security vaults.\n</p><p><br>\nCynthia Bounproff.\n</p><p>Pocket registry: stonework tools, metalwork tools.\n</p><p>Reason for visit: critical fix of a water leak in the high security vaults access. Danger of flooding the chamber.\n</p><p>★Note: Cynthia wasn't carrying a bank pass. Access granted for an urgent patch to prevent more water from reaching the tiles.★\n</p><p><br>\nRakath Glitterbeard. Pocket registry: not declared.\n</p><p>Reason for visit: Give the <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Stone Lord</a> a tour of the lower vaults.\n</p><p>Note: Saer Glitterbeard has requested I step out of the vaults to provide the clients privacy.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211858\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1356/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27089/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8679/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935674/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.099      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.099      1 -total\n 50.30%   20.671      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.76%   18.394     15 